Finished in a dark gunmetal and matte black paint scheme, "Caspian" featured the same oversized chest Arc Reactor housing as Heartbreaker, allowing it to fire concentrated high-output Unibeam blasts. However, Tony integrated radar-absorbent skin panels and thermal-suppression dampeners throughout the frame, enabling the suit to conduct heavy artillery strikes while remaining completely invisible to enemy radar and heat tracking.

In Iron Man 3, Mark XVIII flies into action alongside the rest of the Iron Legion during the battle at the Norco oil rig, engaging Extremis soldiers from above before being destroyed in the final "Clean Slate" detonation order.
